{"id":"d30fced740","t":"Rookie Employee Kim Cheolsu","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/AddText_08-16-04.24.08-193x278.jpg","n":75,"l":75,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu"},"u":1795038217223,"desc":"في يوم تسريحه من الشركة التي كرس حياته لها، عاد بالزمن إلى أول يوم له في العمل. كيم شيول-سو، الموظّف المستجد منخفض المواصفات ينضم إلى شركة هان-يونغ المحلية الرائدة. هل سيتمكّن أخيرًا من تحقيق حلمه الذي طال انتظاره في الغدوّ “رئيسًا تنفيذيًا” في هذه الفرصة الثانية التي منحت له؟","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اقتصاد","خيال","دراما","شونين","عوده بالزمن","غموض"],"src":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/1/"},"2":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/2/"},"3":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/3/"},"4":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/4/"},"5":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/5/"},"6":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/6/"},"7":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/7/"},"8":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/8/"},"9":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/9/"},"10":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/10/"},"11":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/11/"},"12":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/12/"},"13":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/13/"},"14":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/14/"},"15":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/15/"},"16":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu/16/"},"17":{"ml":"rookie-employee-kim-cheolsu|/manga/rookie-employee-kim-ch